  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this project is to strengthen local capacities for peace-building through active and strategic participation in the implementation of the territorial-based development programs (PDETs) and the Integral System of Truth, Justice, Reparation and Non-Repetition (VJRNR system).</narrative>
